//! op-llm: Multi-Provider LLM Integration
//!
//! ## Supported Providers & Endpoints
//!
//! | Provider | Base URL | Auth Method |
//! |----------|----------|-------------|
//! | Antigravity | Gemini API | Headless OAuth (captured from IDE) |
